      "recommendation": "Find out why the screening primary exits with code 15 and fix it before failing back. Keep fraud screening on and do not switch it off. A person must review and correct the 144 duplicate payments in the ledger through the bank's own process, because no allowed action may reverse money or edit postings. Check the payments 1.5 release before it is redeployed. If the primary exits again, investigate the crash before using it again."
